 "answer": "The tag `pg17-bookworm` installs pgvector for Postgres 17 on Debian bookworm. The README lists it with three equivalent tags:\n\n\"- `pg17-bookworm`, `0.8.7-pg17-bookworm`, `pg17`, `0.8.7-pg17`\" [pgvector/README.md]\n\nThe version-pinned form is `0.8.7-pg17-bookworm`. The bare `pg17` and `0.8.7-pg17` tags also point to the bookworm image, based on the README's list, which groups them with the bookworm tags. The README's other Postgres 17 tag, `pg17-trixie`, is the Debian trixie base instead.",
